<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa's Vestacor reconstituted.</title>
<headline>S.Africa's Vestacor reconstituted.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vestacor Ltd said on Monday that the company would be reconstituted and shareholders would receive one share for each existing one held in a mirror company to be named Vestacor Ltd (Newco).</p>
<p>Newco will operate as an investment capital fund.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
